1
00:00:39,892 --> 00:00:45,632
=My Loong=

2
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:48,800
=Episode 21=

3
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:14,640
How dare you!

4
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:17,480
His Majesty the Emperor has arrived!

5
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,040
The Emperor?

6
00:01:23,599 --> 00:01:25,000
The late Emperor

7
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,480
did not die of illness.

8
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,400
In truth, this traitor

9
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,719
murdered his own father

10
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:32,640
to seize the throne.

11
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,159
I have already found

12
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,680
proof of his treason.

13
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:37,879
Today,

14
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:40,359
I will carry out heaven's justice

15
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,319
and set things right!

16
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:48,439
Uncle, what is the meaning of this?

17
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,640
Uncle?

18
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,959
You patricidal traitor,

19
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:56,840
how dare you claim kinship with me?

20
00:01:57,159 --> 00:02:00,239
Today, I will seek justice
for the late Emperor

21
00:02:00,519 --> 00:02:01,640
and purge our royal clan!

22
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,200
I am the traitor?

23
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:05,840
You are the true regicide!

24
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,640
When my father was critically ill,

25
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:08,680
it was you

26
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
who conspired with Physician Sun
to poison him,

27
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,479
and even framed me!

28
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:13,719
Now,

29
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,800
dredging up the past,

30
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:18,680
you still twist the truth
to deceive everyone!

31
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,199
Soldiers,

32
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,199
will you point

33
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:23,560
your blades at me,

34
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,840
or will you cut through the lies
that blind you

35
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:28,800
and seek justice

36
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,199
for the late Emperor?

37
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:33,719
Today,

38
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:36,199
if you raise your weapons with him,

39
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,240
it will be high treason.

40
00:02:39,039 --> 00:02:40,240
Your descendants

41
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,840
will bear your disgrace,

42
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,039
never to rise again!

43
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,759
How will you ever face

44
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:48,159
your ancestors in the underworld?

45
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:50,280
Lower your weapons,

46
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:53,120
and I pardon you of all guilt.

47
00:02:55,599 --> 00:02:56,960
Pardon them of all guilt?

48
00:02:57,639 --> 00:02:58,960
You can barely save yourself.

49
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,400
Archers, ready!

50
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,560
Anyone who hesitates

51
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,479
shares the traitor's guilt.

52
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,280
Kill without mercy!

53
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:09,728
Loose!

54
00:03:34,516 --> 00:03:37,888
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

55
00:03:37,888 --> 00:03:40,960
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

56
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,479
Prince Qi committed treason,

57
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,879
He's beyond redemption!

58
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,000
I am the true Son of Heaven,

59
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:47,960
chosen by destiny!

60
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,520
With divine forces summoned to guard me,

61
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:54,879
this traitor has been captured
on the spot.

62
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:57,639
- Long live the Emperor!
- Long live the Emperor!

63
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,159
- Long live the Emperor!
- Long live the Emperor!

64
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,599
Why are you laughing?

65
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:04,960
Zhu Xun,

66
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:07,719
you celebrate too soon!

67
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,199
However,

68
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:15,439
if Lizhi is determined
to protect the young Emperor,

69
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,519
it will be trouble.

70
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,959
This trap

71
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:25,759
is designed to split Lizhi

72
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,480
and Yue Wangshu apart.

73
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,279
It's best if he doesn't
side with the young Emperor,

74
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:33,360
then our grand plan will be unstoppable.

75
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,680
If he steps in to defend the throne,

76
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,079
he won't be able to protect Yue Wangshu.

77
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:41,800
When that happens,

78
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,040
a defenseless woman

79
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:47,439
will be completely at our mercy.

80
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,560
I'd like to see

81
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,319
if the realm he protects matters more,

82
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:59,800
or the woman in his heart.

83
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,160
Who's there?

84
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:12,639
Xingyao, watch out!

85
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,000
By order,

86
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,439
Lady Wangshu, please come along.

87
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,639
I knew all along

88
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:44,920
that you had him by your side,

89
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:47,360
so I prepared

90
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,800
a foolproof plan.

91
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,759
Master, I truly respect

92
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,519
your divine power.

93
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:55,319
Yet you are not invincible.

94
00:05:56,319 --> 00:05:58,519
When Yue Wangshu was hurt,

95
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,959
your Li Fire almost went out of control,

96
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,079
didn't it?

97
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,079
I

98
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:09,199
had everything about you
thoroughly investigated.

99
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:12,319
You and Yue Wangshu share the same fate,

100
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,720
rising together,

101
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,879
falling together.

102
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,360
If she is injured,

103
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:17,959
you suffer.

104
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,800
If she dies,

105
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:23,040
the Li Fire inside you will turn on you,

106
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,199
destroying you from within!

107
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:25,839
Yue Wangshu

108
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,720
is your fatal weakness

109
00:06:27,959 --> 00:06:29,199
and vulnerability.

110
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,319
So,

111
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,800
I already sent men

112
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:37,560
to keep Yue Wangshu
firmly under my control.

113
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,160
Today,

114
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:44,160
I give you a choice.

115
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:45,480
Either

116
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,000
help me take the throne,

117
00:06:48,519 --> 00:06:49,319
or

118
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:53,360
watch the woman you love

119
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:55,639
perish before your eyes!

120
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,360
Zhu Xun,

121
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,199
did you see it?

122
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,959
This is the heaven's will.

123
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:18,759
I am the true Son of Heaven
chosen by fate!

124
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,199
Are you insane?

125
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:26,920
Don't you

126
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:30,040
care about Yue Wangshu's life anymore?

127
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:32,720
You're right, Uncle.

128
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,199
Master Lizhi

129
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,519
would never leave Wangshu's side.

130
00:07:37,879 --> 00:07:38,399
But

131
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:40,519
what if the one standing before you

132
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:42,000
isn't Master Lizhi at all?

133
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,439
Are you all right?

134
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,879
Who are you?

135
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:21,360
I had prepared for everything.

136
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,120
How could...

137
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:26,959
How could it end like this?

138
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,759
You thought
you could make a loong serve you,

139
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:30,959
but you never know

140
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,480
that at the very beginning,

141
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:35,159
you mistook a flood loong for a loong!

142
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:40,600
Prince Qi's treason
is beyond redemption.

143
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:43,399
Guards,
cast him into the imperial prison

144
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,440
to await sentencing!

145
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:48,000
(Sealed in August, 13th Year of Yongxi)
By Heaven's will, the Emperor decrees:

146
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:49,799
(By Heaven's will, the Emperor decrees)
The criminal woman, Jiang Liuying,

147
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:51,679
conspired with the rebel Prince Qi.

148
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,360
Let go of me!

149
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,240
Plotting treason,

150
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,159
her crime unforgivable!

151
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:54,960
She is to be arrested at once,

152
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,960
her assets confiscated,

153
00:08:56,159 --> 00:08:56,919
to await sentencing.

154
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:58,159
So it is decreed.

155
00:08:58,399 --> 00:08:59,879
What right do you have to arrest me?

156
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,039
I am kin to the General's Manor!

157
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,559
Prince Qi has been brought to justice!

158
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:04,799
You still dare argue?

159
00:09:04,919 --> 00:09:05,504
Take her away!

160
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,639
Let go of me!

161
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,088
Let...

162
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,240
Yang!

163
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,879
Yang!

164
00:09:16,115 --> 00:09:17,408
(Sealed in August, 13th Year of Yongxi)

165
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,120
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:

166
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,440
Prince Qi's treason is unforgivable.

167
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:24,399
As his son, Zhu Heng

168
00:09:24,519 --> 00:09:25,600
should share his guilty.

169
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,879
Yet, since he was
truly unaware of the plot,

170
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,120
out of mercy,

171
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,240
I spare his life.

172
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,679
He is stripped of his title,

173
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:32,919
sent to the North,

174
00:09:33,159 --> 00:09:34,600
confined to the Xishan Villa,

175
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,039
never to leave.

176
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,519
His wife, Lady Yue,

177
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:39,919
daughter of a rebel,
bears even greater guilt.

178
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:41,720
She shall be exiled to the border

179
00:09:41,919 --> 00:09:42,840
as an official slave!

180
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:44,159
So it is decreed.

181
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,200
An official slave?

182
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:46,519
No, I won't!

183
00:09:46,519 --> 00:09:47,919
I am the consort of the Young Lord.

184
00:09:47,919 --> 00:09:48,879
You can't do this to me!

185
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:49,632
Take her away!

186
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,480
Zhu Heng,

187
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,000
tell them

188
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,000
I am your wife!

189
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,480
Save me!

190
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,720
Zhu Heng, save me!

191
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:55,360
Move!

192
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,559
- Zhu Heng!
- Thank you,

193
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:59,159
- Zhu Heng!
- Your Majesty, for sparing my life.

194
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,480
Zhu Heng!

195
00:10:01,076 --> 00:10:02,336
(Zhao, Here lie Lord Yue Huaibang,
General Zhenbei)

196
00:10:02,336 --> 00:10:03,424
(and his wife, First-Rank Madam He)

197
00:10:03,424 --> 00:10:04,320
(Erected by Yue Wangshu,
their filial daughter)

198
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,480
Father,

199
00:10:15,679 --> 00:10:16,320
Mother,

200
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:19,600
the evidence against Prince Qi
and Jiang Liuying is complete.

201
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,720
Jiang Liuying was escorted
to the capital for trial.

202
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:24,679
- Our vengeance is achieved.
- Our vengeance is achieved.

203
00:10:26,159 --> 00:10:28,279
- May your spirits finally rest in peace.
- May your spirits finally rest in peace.

204
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:36,840
Zhang Fan still has loose ends
to tie up.

205
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,159
Once he's finished,

206
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:40,120
I'll take all the dossiers
to the capital.

207
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:43,039
I must witness their end myself.

208
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:44,519
I'll go with you.

209
00:10:44,799 --> 00:10:45,919
Have Lizhi fly us there.

210
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,120
Spare us the journey.

211
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,200
Would he agree to that?

212
00:10:49,399 --> 00:10:50,159
He doesn't

213
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,399
get a say in our business.

214
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:55,639
Have you two actually set a date yet?

215
00:10:57,879 --> 00:10:59,120
Higher!

216
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:04,360
A little higher!

217
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,799
Xingyao!

218
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,008
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

219
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,120
No need for formalities.

220
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:30,360
I just got back from the capital

221
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,440
and wanted to see you.

222
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,480
I heard Master Lanyuan
was also returning,

223
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:35,080
so I hitched a ride with him.

224
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,120
But Master Lanyuan,

225
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,720
you flew so slowly just now,

226
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,440
skimming the water the entire time.

227
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:43,240
It didn't feel like
riding the clouds at all.

228
00:11:45,639 --> 00:11:46,720
I am a flood loong,

229
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,159
not a loong.

230
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,440
Only Lord Lizhi can ride the clouds.

231
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:53,240
Master Lizhi...

232
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,159
In your dreams.

233
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,240
By the way,

234
00:11:58,519 --> 00:12:00,320
when is your wedding date?

235
00:12:01,159 --> 00:12:01,720
Five days later.

236
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,320
A month later.

237
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,759
You keep postponing the wedding.

238
00:12:16,519 --> 00:12:17,519
Do you regret it?

239
00:12:18,919 --> 00:12:20,000
Regretting proposing,

240
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,519
or regretting meeting me?

241
00:12:25,159 --> 00:12:26,039
Of course not.

242
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:27,519
What are you saying?

243
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:28,679
You do!

244
00:12:30,519 --> 00:12:31,519
If not for me,

245
00:12:33,039 --> 00:12:35,159
you could have waited peacefully
to return.

246
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,759
Don't twist my words.

247
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,399
You know very well

248
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,480
I wanted to wait
until everything settles.

249
00:12:40,799 --> 00:12:42,399
If anything goes wrong along the way,

250
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,720
I don't want to ruin your life.

251
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,559
Disperse the qi and restore the core...

252
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:53,799
It's dangerous, isn't it?

253
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:57,159
Buddha Jumps Over the Wall,
Chilled lychees, Laba porridge...

254
00:12:57,519 --> 00:12:58,799
I've never tasted any of those.

255
00:12:59,759 --> 00:13:00,840
These are easy.

256
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,360
Let's fly back to the palace

257
00:13:02,639 --> 00:13:03,720
and try them all.

258
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:07,039
But lychees should be eaten fresh-picked
in Lingnan.

259
00:13:07,399 --> 00:13:09,399
We have lychees right now.

260
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,639
Lizhi!

261
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:18,639
Don't dwell on the future.

262
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,840
Just live in peace.

263
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:29,399
My Lord.

264
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,840
There is still a way

265
00:13:35,679 --> 00:13:36,759
worth trying.

266
00:13:37,399 --> 00:13:38,399
You are a loong,

267
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,399
pure in true essence.

268
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:41,879
Yet this is the mortal realm,

269
00:13:41,879 --> 00:13:43,200
heavy with impurities.

270
00:13:43,759 --> 00:13:44,960
The clash of pure and impure

271
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,039
is the law of heaven,

272
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:48,360
with no natural cure.

273
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,039
Yet if you disperse the qi
and restore the core,

274
00:13:50,279 --> 00:13:51,720
scattering your power

275
00:13:52,519 --> 00:13:53,759
to completely assimilate

276
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,080
into this realm,

277
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,559
then the world is you,

278
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,080
and you are the world.

279
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,720
With no divide of pure and impure,

280
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:04,600
naturally,

281
00:14:05,679 --> 00:14:07,559
there will be no need to return.

282
00:14:08,039 --> 00:14:09,200
Why not tell me sooner?

283
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,679
Dispersing the qi and restoring the core

284
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:16,960
normally takes a century.

285
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,200
However,

286
00:14:19,039 --> 00:14:21,120
the Cloud Steps will open soon.

287
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:22,000
By then,

288
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:24,200
the pure and impure energies
will converge.

289
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,159
Maybe

290
00:14:26,639 --> 00:14:28,039
it could be your chance.

291
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,039
Lizhi, look at me.

292
00:14:38,399 --> 00:14:39,159
Do you really think

293
00:14:39,799 --> 00:14:41,720
calling off the wedding
if something goes wrong

294
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,399
isn't holding me back?

295
00:14:44,799 --> 00:14:46,399
Do you think I could ever forget

296
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,799
all the time we spent together,

297
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,960
act like you never existed,

298
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,639
and simply find someone else

299
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,600
to live a peaceful life?

300
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,200
I can't do that.

301
00:15:08,519 --> 00:15:09,879
Lizhi, you've changed.

302
00:15:11,279 --> 00:15:12,720
You've become like a human.

303
00:15:13,639 --> 00:15:15,600
You've even mastered being insincere,

304
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,840
the worst thing about human.

305
00:15:17,519 --> 00:15:19,159
Back when I first met you,

306
00:15:19,519 --> 00:15:21,840
you would've just told me
that you don't want to,

307
00:15:22,039 --> 00:15:23,639
you won't, and you forbid it.

308
00:15:25,759 --> 00:15:26,519
That's because...

309
00:15:26,519 --> 00:15:28,080
Because you love me.

310
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,840
You care about me,

311
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:34,360
even more than you care about yourself.

312
00:15:37,759 --> 00:15:38,679
Lizhi,

313
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:41,159
I want to marry you.

314
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,200
I want to be etched
deep into your heart.

315
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,159
I want you never to forget

316
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:48,159
that you have a wife bound to you.

317
00:15:49,639 --> 00:15:51,440
I want to be your reason

318
00:15:52,279 --> 00:15:54,759
to fight with your life to return.

319
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,639
I believe you'll make it.

320
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:01,320
If you believe in yourself too,

321
00:16:02,759 --> 00:16:04,159
then marry me.

322
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,000
Will you?

323
00:16:17,399 --> 00:16:18,200
Yes.

324
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,159
Let's marry.

325
00:16:21,679 --> 00:16:22,639
Let's get married.

326
00:16:45,299 --> 00:16:49,874
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

327
00:16:50,649 --> 00:16:55,146
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

328
00:16:58,385 --> 00:17:03,507
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

329
00:17:03,507 --> 00:17:06,846
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

330
00:17:06,846 --> 00:17:08,210
♪Refusing to forget♪

331
00:17:11,876 --> 00:17:16,653
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

332
00:17:17,204 --> 00:17:18,994
♪He cannot learn them♪

333
00:17:18,994 --> 00:17:22,129
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

334
00:17:25,281 --> 00:17:27,605
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

335
00:17:27,605 --> 00:17:29,968
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

336
00:17:30,546 --> 00:17:33,210
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

337
00:17:33,210 --> 00:17:34,968
♪Their days ahead are long♪
